2:T778,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does kitchen fitting cost in the UK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"As a rough guide, fitting labour for a typical kitchen may cost around £2,000 to £6,000, excluding units, worktops and appliances. Small or simple installations may cost less, while complex projects can cost more. Every project differs, so get a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does it cost to fit a kitchen from B&Q or IKEA?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The fitting cost depends on the number of units, room preparation, worktops, appliances and service alterations. A supplier’s installation price may not include every plumbing, electrical, tiling or decorating task, so check the scope carefully."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does kitchen fitting include plumbing and electrics?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not always. Some installers may include basic connections, but moving water, waste, gas or electrical points can be priced separately. Ask for each trade and task to be listed clearly in the quotation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does it take to fit a kitchen?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The duration varies with the size of the kitchen, room preparation, deliveries and the number of trades involved. A straightforward installation may be completed more quickly than a full renovation involving structural work, new services, tiling or flooring."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I reduce the cost of a kitchen refit?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Keeping the existing layout, comparing materials, retaining suitable appliances and avoiding unnecessary structural changes can reduce costs. Do not omit essential preparation, safe connections or ventilation to save money."}}]}7:["slug","how-much-does-kitchen-fitting-cost-uk","d"]
9:T4d5,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"HomeAndConstructionBusiness","name":"BMB Renovation","url":"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk","logo":"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk/favicon.svg","image":"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk/og-image.png","description":"BMB Renovation offers premium home, kitchen & bathroom renovation services in Watford, London & Hertfordshire. 15+ years of experience. Free consultation.","telephone":"+447775758717","email":"contact@bmbrenovation.co.uk","priceRange":"££","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"157 Judge Street","addressLocality":"Watford","postalCode":"WD24 5AN","addressRegion":"Hertfordshire","addressCountry":"GB"},"geo":{"@type":"GeoCoordinates","latitude":51.6549,"longitude":-0.3978},"areaServed":["Watford","Bushey","Rickmansworth","St Albans","Hemel Hempstead","Borehamwood","Harrow","Croxley Green","Luton","Bedford","London"],"openingHoursSpecification":[{"@type":"OpeningHoursSpecification","dayOfWeek":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday"],"opens":"08:00","closes":"18:00"},{"@type":"OpeningHoursSpecification","dayOfWeek":"Saturday","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:00"}],"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/bmbrenovation","https://www.instagram.com/bmbrenovation"]}0:["BIhS_gHZZJd6Y-soQ8kJZ",[[["",{"children":["blog",{"children":[["slug","how-much-does-kitchen-fitting-cost-uk","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"how-much-does-kitchen-fitting-cost-uk\"}",{}]}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["blog",{"children":[["slug","how-much-does-kitchen-fitting-cost-uk","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen flex flex-col","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"How Much Does Kitchen Fitting Cost UK?\",\"description\":\"How much does kitchen fitting cost UK? Learn typical labour prices, what installation includes, key cost factors and how to budget accurately for your project.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-30T10:33:24.340Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-30T10:33:24.340Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BMB Renovation\",\"url\":\"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BMB Renovation\",\"url\":\"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk/og-image.png\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk/blog/how-much-does-kitchen-fitting-cost-uk\",\"keywords\":\"kitchen fitting cost UK, kitchen installation prices, kitchen fitter labour cost, how much does a new kitchen cost, kitchen renovation costs\"}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk/blog\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"How Much Does Kitchen Fitting Cost UK?\",\"item\":\"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk/blog/how-much-does-kitchen-fitting-cost-uk\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","$L3",null,{}],["$","section",null,{"className":"relative pt-28 pb-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-white/50 mb-6","aria-label":"Breadcrumb","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/","className":"hover:text-[#C8A97E] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-house w-3.5 h-3.5","children":[["$","path","5wwlr5",{"d":"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8"}],["$","path","1d0kgt",{"d":"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-5.999a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 5.999A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"}],"$undefined"]}]," Home"]}],["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3 h-3","children":[["$","path","mthhwq",{"d":"m9 18 6-6-6-6"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/blog","className":"hover:text-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"Blog"}],["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-3 h-3","children":[["$","path","mthhwq",{"d":"m9 18 6-6-6-6"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/80 truncate max-w-[200px] sm:max-w-none","children":"How Much Does Kitchen Fitting Cost UK?"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/10 text-[#C8A97E] text-xs mb-4","children":"how much does kitchen fitting cost uk"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight","children":"How Much Does Kitchen Fitting Cost UK?"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 text-white/50 text-sm mt-5","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-calendar w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1cmpym",{"d":"M8 2v4"}],["$","path","4m81vk",{"d":"M16 2v4"}],["$","rect","1hopcy",{"width":"18","height":"18","x":"3","y":"4","rx":"2"}],["$","path","8toen8",{"d":"M3 10h18"}],"$undefined"]}],"30 July 2026",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/25","children":"·"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"BMB Renovation"}]]}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"py-14 sm:py-20 flex-grow bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["If you are researching how much kitchen fitting costs in the UK, the first thing to know is that there is no single standard price. A straightforward installation may cost a few thousand pounds in labour, while a complete kitchen renovation involving new services, flooring, tiling and structural changes can cost considerably more. The final figure depends on the size of the room, the kitchen you choose, the condition of the existing space and how much work is included. As a rough guide, fitting labour for a typical kitchen may be around £2,000 to £6,000, excluding units and appliances. More complex projects can cost more. Every project differs, so obtain a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Typical kitchen fitting costs in the UK"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Kitchen fitting usually refers to the labour required to install the units, worktops and associated components. As a rough guide, fitting labour for a small or simple kitchen where the existing layout and services stay broadly the same may typically be around £1,500 to £3,000. A medium-sized kitchen with more cabinets, worktop joints and additional trades may typically be around £3,000 to £6,000. A large, bespoke or complicated installation may cost £6,000 to £10,000 or more. These are broad, indicative UK ranges rather than fixed prices; regional labour rates, access, project complexity and the contractor’s scope all make a difference. Every project differs, so request a free quote for accurate pricing."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["As a rough guide, fitting-only labour for many standard UK kitchens may typically be around £1,500–£6,000, depending on size and complexity."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["As a rough guide, a complete new kitchen including units, worktops, appliances and installation may typically cost around £8,000–£25,000 or more."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["A premium or bespoke kitchen with specialist worktops, high-end appliances or major building work may cost substantially more."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["A kitchen refresh involving replacement doors, worktops or appliances may cost less than a full strip-out and refit. Every project differs, so get a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}]]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Thinking about your own project?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation covers Watford, Bushey, Rickmansworth, St Albans, Hemel Hempstead and beyond — all trades in-house. Call +44 7775 758 717 or send us a message."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","children":["Get a Free Quote",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"What is included in kitchen installation?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["A kitchen fitting quotation should clearly state which tasks are included and which are priced separately. Standard installation may cover assembling and securing base and wall units, fitting plinths and panels, installing handles, fitting worktops and making cut-outs for sinks or hobs where appropriate. It may also include hanging doors, fitting drawers and connecting some appliances. However, appliance connections, waste removal, decorating and alterations to plumbing or electrics are not always included in a basic fitting price."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"Common additional work to check"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Removing and disposing of the old kitchen, flooring, wall tiles and unwanted appliances."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Moving water, waste, gas or electrical points to suit a new layout."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Installing or upgrading sockets, lighting, extraction and appliance supplies."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Plastering, making good walls, painting and decorating after the old units are removed."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Fitting wall and floor tiles, vinyl, laminate, timber or other flooring."]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Connecting appliances, sinks, taps and waste systems, subject to the installer’s scope and the qualifications required for the work."]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Cutting and fitting specialist worktops such as quartz, granite or solid wood."]}]]}],["$","li","7",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Repairing damp, uneven floors, damaged plaster or other problems found behind the existing kitchen."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"The main factors affecting kitchen fitting cost"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The number of units is only one part of the calculation. A quote is also influenced by the condition of the room, the number of trades involved and the precision required for the materials selected. Keeping the existing layout can reduce labour because water, waste and electrical points may not need to move. Changing the position of the sink, cooker or dishwasher often adds time and may require several trades."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Room size and layout: larger kitchens need more units, longer worktops and additional installation time."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Kitchen style: flat-pack units may have different labour requirements from rigid, bespoke or hand-painted cabinetry."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Worktops: laminate is generally simpler to install, while stone and other heavy materials may require accurate templating and specialist fitting."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Appliances: integrated appliances, built-in extraction and complex plumbing can take longer than freestanding alternatives."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Services: moving gas, water, waste or electrical supplies can increase both labour and materials costs."]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Walls and floors: uneven surfaces, old plaster, damaged flooring or damp may need correcting before installation."]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Access: narrow hallways, upper-floor rooms, parking restrictions and limited storage can affect delivery and labour time."]}]]}],["$","li","7",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Finishing work: tiling, splashbacks, painting, flooring, lighting and decorating can form a significant part of the overall budget."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"How to budget accurately for a kitchen refit"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Start by deciding whether you need fitting only, a full replacement kitchen or a wider renovation. Ask suppliers and installers to separate units, worktops, appliances, labour and finishing work, rather than accepting one unexplained total. This makes it easier to compare like-for-like quotations and identify items you may have assumed were included."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"A practical budgeting checklist"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Measure the room carefully, but arrange a site survey before relying on measurements for ordering."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["List every appliance and decide whether it will be freestanding or integrated."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Confirm the worktop material, sink, tap, handles, splashback and storage accessories."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Allow for removal, delivery, waste disposal and any temporary cooking arrangements."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Ask whether plumbing, electrical work, tiling, flooring, plastering and decorating are included."]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Include a contingency for unexpected work, particularly in older properties. Every project is different, and hidden defects cannot always be identified before strip-out."]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Check the payment schedule, estimated duration, responsibility for ordering materials and process for approving variations."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Getting comparable kitchen fitting quotes"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The most useful quotation is detailed enough for you to understand what will happen from removal through to final clean-up. It should describe the proposed layout, materials, preparation work, installation tasks and exclusions. Be cautious of comparing a low fitting price with a comprehensive quote that includes several trades. A cheaper figure may leave you paying separately for old kitchen removal, appliance connections, tile removal, flooring or making good."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["For homeowners in Hertfordshire, North London and Bedfordshire, BMB Renovation provides kitchen fitting and renovation services from its base at 157 Judge Street, Watford WD24 5AN. All plumbing, tiling, electrical and cabinet installation work is handled in-house. BMB Renovation offers free, no-obligation quotes; you can ",["$","$L4","0",{"href":"/contact","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"contact the team"}]," or review the ",["$","$L4","1",{"href":"/kitchen-fitting-watford","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"kitchen fitting service in Watford"}]," before arranging a conversation."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Ways to control the cost without compromising the result"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["If the budget is tight, keeping the existing layout is often one of the most effective ways to reduce labour. You could also compare worktop materials, retain sound appliances, replace doors rather than every cabinet and phase decorative improvements. However, avoid cutting costs by overlooking preparation or essential electrical and plumbing work. A well-fitted kitchen relies on accurate levelling, suitable support, safe connections and adequate ventilation, so the cheapest initial quote is not necessarily the lowest overall cost."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Before work begins, agree the design, product specifications, schedule and quotation in writing. Confirm who orders the units and appliances, who checks deliveries for damage, and how changes will be priced. Taking these steps gives you a more realistic kitchen fitting budget and reduces the chance of unexpected costs during installation."]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Get a Free, No-Obligation Quote"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation handles kitchens, bathrooms and full home renovations across Watford, Hertfordshire, North London & Bedfordshire — all trades in-house. Tell us about your project today."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","children":["Get My Free Quote",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-14","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-6","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-help w-6 h-6 text-[#C8A97E]","children":[["$","circle","1mglay",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["$","path","1u773s",{"d":"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"}],["$","path","p32p05",{"d":"M12 17h.01"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight","children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","details","0",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm open:border-[#C8A97E]/40","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm 